From: Nautilus Extended
Subject: [PATCH] Add independent custom icons and native Nautilus icon pickers

Store a sidebar-only symbolic SVG URI with validated change/reset actions.
Use NautilusFileChooser for both bookmark and Properties icon selection,
sharing view/zoom/window settings while retaining Properties image validation.
Keep a regular file alive while selecting it in its parent directory.

